{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1133724,\"title\":\"Little Blue Box\",\"tagline\":\"Before They Created Apple, Jobs And Wozniak Hacked The Phone System\",\"overview\":\"Some 1960s hackers known as phone phreaks found a way to avoid long-distance charges. Two of those phreaks just happened to be students named Steve Wozniak and Steve Jobs.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ebkyBzho4CMIjTxeiCHH4fTz6s0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmCUbmqVv8EpUA2ZjiW4mCzoiCO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":12,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Michael Galinsky\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":95432,\"name\":\"Michael Galinsky\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1286511,\"name\":\"David Beilinson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":95433,\"name\":\"Suki Hawley\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":127286,\"name\":\"Steve Wozniak\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e82vzfieRhpZ961pkTZbpfsWi6Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":12897,\"name\":\"Steve Jobs\",\"character\":\"Self (archive footage)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n71rW0xTowxKD0HwvLiWkaIfgbf.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":651724,\"title\":\"The Irishman: In Conversation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fF704pR8xsNjI7dVi4M4rPUqxvU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bumVsJP2qHFSx96JeOu3DvXTdxO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Martin Scorsese, Robert De Niro, Joe Pesci, and Al Pacino in conversation about The Irishman.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":292848,\"title\":\"The Figures Carved into the Knife By the Sap of the Banana Trees\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The rapid turning of a light draws a circle. In the space bound by its line unravels an archive of postcards sent between the island of Madeira and the former Portuguese colony of Mozambique. The figures carved into the Knife by the Sap of the Banana Trees circulates between a fictional colonial memory, and science-fiction.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":865374,\"title\":\"Honour to Senator Murray Sinclair\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rNGHyAn3UYmFB4edRK5QOjo7o4l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Murray Sinclair's acceptance speech for an award in honor of his role as chair of the Truth and Reconciliation Commission of Canada, intercut with the testimonies of survivors of the Indian residential school system.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":667754,\"title\":\"Galapagos Suite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wOrL9XRJiSADm6wVmGXcS1Umq1B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rHz4Q4uW91YdFSZ9PKsRcgxpYzy.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Galapagos Suite is a 17-minute compilation of 16 days sailing around the Galapagos archipelago aboard the Anahi catamaran. It seeks to encapsulate and capture the experience with intimate videography by Jim Lawrence and an original music score by Christian Jessup.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":289005,\"title\":\"Who's Afraid of Cris Negão?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/keJtUw5MXQB260KViQwLeccPEGP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cristiane Jordan, or Cris Negão, as she was called, was a transvestite who worked as a bawd in downtown of São Paulo known by her violent methods to control the other transvestites. Hated and feared by a legion, she also had her fans until she was tragically murdered with two shots in the head. The documentary is a dive into the transvestite universe through the stories of this legendary character of São Paulo's underworld.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1455317,\"title\":\"A Stop Gap Measure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/14Lxa43S8OxKwsjA5CHFkPIvbT2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When temporary solutions become the status quo, who gets left behind? A Stop Gap Measure follows disability activist Luke Anderson in his fight for accessibility to be a right, not a privilege.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1455332,\"title\":\"La Femme Equi-Libre\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/454cP0ww90rwzVE2d2D6UnsaGOL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Prince Edward Island, Josée Gallant-Gordon is reinventing mental health care through her bilingual equine therapy centre, proving that with ideas, one person can transform their community.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1455076,\"title\":\"Crossing the Divide\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fGTTn2bvFBxgRXWy5YbeuW4x6Z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two Canadians, one Liberal and one Conservative, attend a U.S. convention focused on depolarizing politics, determined to engage in tough conversations for a healthier democracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1648278,\"title\":\"Darryl Henriques Is in Show Business\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"People in the entertainment industry recognize Darryl Henriques as an immensely talented comedian: one who creates a unique and biting commentary on modern life. Yet, up until now he's been unable to break through and make a living as a performer. This is mostly because Darryl is driven to speak the truth, as he sees it, even when it conflicts with his ambitions. All his life, Darryl has been caught between his desire for success and his need to challenge authority - both on and off stage. At times, Darryl deliberately alienates his audience with his improvised routines and then tries to win them back. Such theatrics give pause to the people who could help Darryl to become more of a commercial success. This film is a portrait of an artist struggling to come to terms with his eccentricities as he attempts to gain access to a larger audience without compromising his spontaneity or the integrity of his humor.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":866710,\"title\":\"Escape\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n0jkgQKkFmsgHIOvCA6UwReQcNX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fm01Slje0FDxfUyWYYxyalM7h6v.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"JaBig, a Montreal-based DJ, is on a quest to beat the record for the longest continuous bike ride in a single country. Join him on the last day of his ride to discover what happens when you stop listening to all the reasons why you shouldn’t, and listen to the voice inside you, telling you to go.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ZqtbgeJ_8Uk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"cSF3RG7B5mE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"rrtweM0XRQw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}